WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Drag Thank you to the top of the slide list. The preview changes with it.

00:08.000 --> 00:14.000
Drag the divider beside the slide list to make the list wider.

00:14.000 --> 00:20.000
Overview shows every slide as a card, in the new order.

00:20.000 --> 00:28.000
Markdown shows the full file beside the preview. Drag the center divider to resize the split.

00:28.000 --> 00:36.000
Visual returns to one slide, with the list, the preview, and the slide editor.
